---
const ja = Astro.props.lang === 'ja';
---
<figure class="v3-flow" data-route="all" aria-label={ja ? 'モデル振り分けの例。アプリは共通のURLへモデル名を送り、ngx_mrubyが利用者キーを確認して送信先と上流のキーを選ぶ。nginxが応答を中継する。' : 'Model-routing example. The app sends a model name to one URL. ngx_mruby checks the client key and selects the upstream and its credential. nginx relays the response.'}>
  <div class="flow-stage">
    <div class="flow-clients agent-node">
      <h3 class="flow-title">{ja ? 'アプリ' : 'Your app'}</h3>
      <code>POST /v1/responses</code>
      <span class="api-contract">{ja ? '共通のURL・同じAPI形式' : 'One URL, the same API format'}</span>
      <div class="route-controls" hidden><button type="button" data-model="a" aria-pressed="false">{ja ? 'モデルA' : 'Model A'}</button><button type="button" data-model="b" aria-pressed="false">{ja ? 'モデルB' : 'Model B'}</button><details class="route-proof"><summary>{ja ? '検証用の名前との対応' : 'Names used in the test'}</summary><span class="route-result" aria-live="polite"></span></details></div>
    </div>
    <div class="gateway">
      <h3 class="flow-title">ngx_mruby</h3>
      <div class="ruby-core"><ul role="list"><li>{ja ? '利用者キーを確認' : 'Check the client key'}</li><li>{ja ? 'モデルから転送先を選択' : 'Select the route by model'}</li><li>{ja ? '上流のAPIキーに置換' : 'Apply the provider key'}</li></ul></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-providers"><span class="flow-wire" aria-hidden="true">→</span><div><h3 class="flow-title">LLM API</h3><div class="provider-node" data-provider="a"><strong>{ja ? 'モデルA' : 'Model A'}</strong><span>{ja ? '上流キーA' : 'Provider key A'}</span></div><div class="provider-node" data-provider="b"><strong>{ja ? 'モデルB' : 'Model B'}</strong><span>{ja ? '上流キーB' : 'Provider key B'}</span></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>{ja ? 'nextの検証用モデルA/Bを示す図です。選択は表示だけを変え、外部APIへは送信しません。' : 'A/B are test models from next. Selecting one changes this illustration without sending an API request.'}</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
  for (const figure of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.v3-flow')) {
    const controls = figure.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.route-controls');
    if (!controls) continue;
    controls.hidden = false;
    for (const button of controls.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-model]')) {
      button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const model = button.dataset.model;
        figure.dataset.route = model;
        for (const other of controls.querySelectorAll('button')) other.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(other === button));
        const result = controls.querySelector('.route-result');
        if (result) result.textContent = `mock-model-${model} → agent_proxy_llm_${model}`;
        for (const node of figure.querySelectorAll('.ruby-core, .provider-node')) {
          node.classList.remove('route-pulse');
          // Restart a finite user-triggered route indication; nothing moves on load.
          void (node as HTMLElement).offsetWidth;
          if (!node.hasAttribute('data-provider') || node.getAttribute('data-provider') === model) node.classList.add('route-pulse');
        }
      });
    }
  }
</script>
